    "preamble": "Ganesh Suvalal Gandhi vs State Of Maharashtra on 20 December, 2023 Author: N. J. Jamadar Bench: N. J. Jamadar Sayali 909-Aba-3567-23. Deepak Upasani Digitally signed by Sa Sayali Deepak Upasani Date: 2023.12.22 17:54:57 +0530 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No. 3567 Of 2023 Ganesh Suvalal Gandhi ...Appl Vs. The State of Maharashtra ...Respond Mr. Rajesh More, for Applicant. Smt. Ashwini A. Takalkar, App for State. Coram:- N. J. Jamadar, J.",
